{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24082","headline":"春寒 · 白居易","name":"春寒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今朝春气寒，自问何所欲。\n酥煖薤白酒，乳和地黄粥。\n岂惟厌馋口，亦可调病腹。\n助酌有枯鱼，佐餐兼旨蓄。\n省躬念前哲，醉饱多惭忸。\n君不闻靖节先生尊长空，广文先生饭不足。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24082.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24082","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}